{#- Single source of truth for "is this a builder image?".

    `is_builder` is computed in Python (hb_variant.is_builder_variant) from the
    variant name, so composite variants such as "fips-builder" or
    "fpm-builder-fips" are recognised. Comparing `variant == "builder"` — the
    previous test — silently produced a non-builder image for every composite
    builder variant: no builder packages, no builder dnf defaults, and
    cleanup_newroot() stripped /usr/share/licenses and locales out of it.

    Returns the STRING "true"/"false" so existing Containerfile.j2 templates
    that compare `is_builder_variant() == "true"` keep working. Prefer the
    `is_builder` boolean directly in new templates. -#}
{%- macro is_builder_variant() -%}
{%- if is_builder -%}
true
{%- else -%}
false
{%- endif -%}
{%- endmacro -%}
